{"lines": ["Now a different kind of silence. The northern Urals, February 1959. Nine hikers, led by twenty-three-year-old Igor Dyatlov, are on a ski trek toward a mountain called Otorten.", "One of them, Yuri Yudin, turned back on the twenty-eighth of January with joint pain. He would be the only one to survive.", "On the twenty-sixth of February, searchers found the tent on Kholat Syakhl. It was half torn down and covered with snow. Belongings and shoes were still inside.", "Investigators said the tent had been cut open from the inside.", "Nine sets of footprints led away, in socks, in one shoe, some barefoot, toward the edge of the forest. The temperature was around minus twenty-five to minus thirty, with a storm.", "The first rumour was an attack by the Mansi people, who herd reindeer in that region. Several Mansi were questioned. But the investigation found only the hikers' own footprints, and no sign of a struggle.", "Rule two. Read the bodies and the ground, not the rumours."], "words": [["Now", 0.0, 0.2], ["a", 0.2, 0.32], ["different", 0.32, 0.52], ["kind", 0.52, 0.8], ["of", 0.8, 0.92], ["silence.", 0.92, 1.14], ["The", 2.0, 2.05], ["northern", 2.05, 2.3], ["Urals,", 2.3, 2.92], ["February", 2.92, 3.1], ["1959.", 3.1, 3.74], ["Nine", 4.96, 5.34], ["hikers,", 5.34, 5.78], ["led", 5.78, 6.12], ["by", 6.12, 6.36], ["twenty-three-year-old", 6.36, 7.4], ["Igor", 7.4, 7.62], ["Dyatlov,", 7.62, 8.34], ["are", 8.34, 8.74], ["on", 8.74, 8.86], ["a", 8.86, 8.94], ["ski", 8.94, 9.16], ["trek", 9.16, 9.42], ["toward", 9.42, 9.74], ["a", 9.74, 9.88], ["mountain", 9.88, 10.16], ["called", 10.16, 10.62], ["Otorten.", 10.62, 11.94], ["One", 11.94, 12.22], ["of", 12.22, 12.34], ["them,", 12.34, 12.5], ["Yuri", 12.68, 12.8], ["Yudin,", 12.8, 13.32], ["turned", 13.56, 13.78], ["back", 13.78, 14.12], ["on", 14.12, 14.38], ["the", 14.38, 14.44], ["twenty-eighth", 14.44, 15.14], ["of", 15.14, 15.19], ["January", 15.19, 15.52], ["with", 15.52, 15.82], ["joint", 15.82, 16.0], ["pa